  - "{{saat, G\xFCnayd\u0131n | \u0130yi \xF6\u011Flenler | \u0130yi \xF6\u011Fleden
    sonralar\u0131 | \u0130yi ak\u015Famlar | \u0130yi geceler}}. Magnus'a ho\u015F
